                  <msItem xml:id="Tib_blockbooks_a_39_6-item1">
                     <title key="work_946" xml:lang="bo">mdzod</title>
                     <title key="work_946" xml:lang="540 x 90">ཆོས་མངོན་པ་མཛོད་གསལ་བར་བྱེད་པ་ཆོས་མངོན་པ་རིན་ཆེན་འདྲེན་པའི་ཤིང་རྟམཛོད</title>
                     <title type="margin" xml:lang="bo">myong ba'i yid tshor de yin pa'i phyir/ shes bya chos can/ btang snyoms kyi dbang po yod de/ sim gdung bar ma tsam du nyams su myong ba'i sems byung de yin pa'i phyir te/ de gnyis kar mi gtogs pa'i phyir//</title>
                     <title type="margin" xml:lang="540 x 90">མཛོད</title>
                     <author key="person_2017054736">
                        <persName xml:lang="bo">chos mngon pa mdzod gsal bar byed pa chos mngon pa rin chen 'dren pa'i shing rta</persName> (<persName xml:lang="540 x 90">ངག་དབང་བློ་བཟང་རྒྱ་མཚོ</persName>)</author>
                     <note>TBRC: W237</note>
                     <incipit xml:lang="bo">ces chos mngon pa mdzod gsal par byed pa chos mngon rin chen 'dren pa'i shing rta zhes bya ba 'di yang / 'jam dbyangs gzhon nu mthon mthing ral pa'i zur phud dor te/ ngur smrig gi bla gos kyis mdzes par klubs pa'i slob dpon rin po che dkon mchog chos 'phel gyis/ rang phyogs kyi bstan pa 'di la mngon pa'i skor mtha' chod pa'i yig cha cung zad dkon par 'dug pas 'di lta bu zhig gyis shig ces mka' bstsal pa dang / rje rgyal ba gnyis pa'i chos kyi khrir mngon par 'jags pa'i thub bstan yongs su rdzogs pa'i bshes gnyen chen po chos rgyal bkra shis kyi gsung gis bskul zhing / ri bo bde chen gyi mkhan chen 'jam dbyangs bkra shis dang / rigs lam smra ba'i 'dus sde'i khyu mchog mkhas mang blo gsal gling gi slob dpon don mthun gyi 'chad nyan pa dam chos rnam rgyal/ legs bshad chos 'khor gling gi slob dpon bstan 'dzin 'phris dang /</incipit>
                     <colophon xml:lang="bo">The text is incomplete with all folios before folio 50 missing except folio 29 and the last folio is also missing.</colophon>
